  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Part three of the Mafia crime saga – 1968, New Bordeaux, LA:</b><br>\nAfter years of combat in Vietnam, Lincoln Clay knows this truth: family isn’t who you’re born with, it’s who you die for. When his surrogate family is wiped out by the Italian Mafia, Lincoln builds a new family and blazes a path of revenge through the Mafioso responsible.<p></p>\n<p><b>NEW BORDEAUX, LA:</b><br>\nA vast world ruled by the mob and detailed with the sights and sounds of the era</p>\n<p><b>A LETHAL ANTI-HERO:</b><br>\nBe Lincoln Clay, orphan and Vietnam veteran hell bent on revenge for the deaths of his surrogate family</p>\n<p><b>REVENGE YOUR WAY:</b><br>\nChoose your own play-style; brute force, blazing guns or stalk-and-kill tactics, to tear down the Mafia</p>\n<p><b>A NEW FAMILY ON THE ASHES OF THE OLD:</b><br>\nBuild a new criminal empire your way by deciding which lieutenants you reward, and which you betray</p>\n",
